Controller SQLiteDataStore integration tests
--------------------------------------------
ControllerSQLiteDataStoreIntegrationTest.listEntriesShowsSeededFacilities - list shows the seeded facilities
ControllerSQLiteDataStoreIntegrationTest.listEntriesShowsSeededAgents - list shows the seeded agents
ControllerSQLiteDataStoreIntegrationTest.listEntriesShowsSeededMissions - list shows the seeded missions
ControllerSQLiteDataStoreIntegrationTest.readEntryShowsSeededBrief - read shows a seeded brief
ControllerSQLiteDataStoreIntegrationTest.readEntryShowsSeededAgent - read shows a seeded agent
ControllerSQLiteDataStoreIntegrationTest.readEntryNotFoundOnRealStore - unknown id reports not found
ControllerSQLiteDataStoreIntegrationTest.addEntryPersistsBriefInRealStore - added brief is in the store
ControllerSQLiteDataStoreIntegrationTest.addEntryPersistsAgentInRealStore - added agent is in the store
ControllerSQLiteDataStoreIntegrationTest.addEntryPersistsFacilityInRealStore - added facility is in the store
ControllerSQLiteDataStoreIntegrationTest.editEntryUpdatesRealBrief - edited brief title changes in the store
ControllerSQLiteDataStoreIntegrationTest.editEntryRejectsUnknownIdOnRealStore - unknown id reports not found
ControllerSQLiteDataStoreIntegrationTest.assignAgentToMissionWorksOnRealStore - assignment lands in the join table
ControllerSQLiteDataStoreIntegrationTest.assignAgentToMissionRejectsUnknownAgent - unknown agent reports not found
Notes: real SQLiteDataStore on a test database behind the full
Controller; users, access, audit, and messages stay mocked.
The test database seeds the dataset TSVs (6 facilities, 100
missions, 100 briefs, 10 agents). editEntryUpdatesRealBrief
fails until the store implements the update methods.
Run: .\gradlew test --tests "control.ControllerSQLiteDataStoreIntegrationTest" --console=plain
